# Unified codebase: no API base URL is needed.
# The client calls the relative path /api/v1 — Vite proxies it to the
# server in development, and in production the server serves this client
# itself (same origin).
# Set this ONLY if you deliberately run the client against a server on a
# different origin:
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:4000/api/v1
